{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Fashion Designer",
    "steam_appid": 1226580,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1226580/extras/b2065d90abb4de25b950d171f16656b7.avif?t=1672397617\" /></div><br>Fashion Designer is a game in which you play the role of a fashion designer. Buy sewing machines, design clothes, choose materials and sew. Control the movements of models at fashion shows and be ranked by the jury. Unlock new templates and create amazing outfits.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1226580/extras/fe0364113dfe609ddb99131733f986e5.avif?t=1672397617\" /></div><br>Gain points for your creations, fashion shows and upgrade your equipment. Buy high-class sewing machines and create even more complex outfits. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1226580/extras/c05b1da1aa966ea79925233f72da0775.avif?t=1672397617\" /></div><br>Unlock new sewing templates and create new outfits using interesting materials. Overcome the difficulties associated with complex shapes and indents.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1226580/extras/b8300f1ceef46ca23895919c622cf16b.avif?t=1672397617\" /></div><br>Have fun with the dynamic sewing mode. Gain manual skills by controlling the direction and balance of the needle. Guide the thread along pre-determined templates and score points.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1226580/extras/70252b144932af407f5ad15d60d63bd2.avif?t=1672397617\" /></div><br>Spend your points on buttons, pockets, zippers, patches, bows, sequins and other accessories available to unlock.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1226580/extras/dc0c71ff41a5fb6993dc4ad5888e96d6.avif?t=1672397617\" /></div><br>Let the model present your creations at the Fashion Show! Your work will be evaluated in terms of design, quality, comfort, price, and presentation of your model!",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1226580/extras/b2065d90abb4de25b950d171f16656b7.avif?t=1672397617\" /></div><br>Fashion Designer is a game in which you play the role of a fashion designer. Buy sewing machines, design clothes, choose materials and sew. Control the movements of models at fashion shows and be ranked by the jury. Unlock new templates and create amazing outfits.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1226580/extras/fe0364113dfe609ddb99131733f986e5.avif?t=1672397617\" /></div><br>Gain points for your creations, fashion shows and upgrade your equipment. Buy high-class sewing machines and create even more complex outfits. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1226580/extras/c05b1da1aa966ea79925233f72da0775.avif?t=1672397617\" /></div><br>Unlock new sewing templates and create new outfits using interesting materials. Overcome the difficulties associated with complex shapes and indents.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1226580/extras/b8300f1ceef46ca23895919c622cf16b.avif?t=1672397617\" /></div><br>Have fun with the dynamic sewing mode. Gain manual skills by controlling the direction and balance of the needle. Guide the thread along pre-determined templates and score points.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1226580/extras/70252b144932af407f5ad15d60d63bd2.avif?t=1672397617\" /></div><br>Spend your points on buttons, pockets, zippers, patches, bows, sequins and other accessories available to unlock.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1226580/extras/dc0c71ff41a5fb6993dc4ad5888e96d6.avif?t=1672397617\" /></div><br>Let the model present your creations at the Fashion Show! Your work will be evaluated in terms of design, quality, comfort, price, and presentation of your model!",
